# nexora-action-code: get_stp
Value Filldown INSTANCE_TYPE (instance|VLAN)
Value Filldown,Required INSTANCE (\d+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (\d+:\d+)
Value DESIGNATED_PORT_ID (\d+:\d+)
Value DESIGNATED_BRIDGE (\d+\.[0-9a-fA-F]{12})
Value COST (\d+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value ROLE (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Spanning tree interface parameters for ${INSTANCE_TYPE} ${INSTANCE}\s*$$ -> Ports

Ports
  ^\s*Spanning tree interface parameters for ${INSTANCE_TYPE} ${INSTANCE}\s*$$
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${PORT_ID}\s+${DESIGNATED_PORT_ID}\s+${DESIGNATED_BRIDGE}\s+${COST}\s+${STATE}\s+${ROLE}\s*$$ -> Record

EOF
